---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /kavi/
compactHeader: true
pageTitle: Kavi
pageDescription: Kavi bahut kuch kehte hain. JB ko janne ke liye unka Instagram, aur unki kavitaien.
---
<a class="back" href="{{ '/' | url }}">&larr; Sab kavitaien</a>

<article class="prose">
  <h2 class="page-title">Kavi bahut kuch kehte hain</h2>

  <div class="insta-pair">
    <a class="insta" href="https://instagram.com/{{ site.instagram }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">
      <span class="insta-label">Kavi ko janne ke liye</span>
      <span class="insta-handle">@{{ site.instagram }}</span>
    </a>

    {% if site.instagram_poetry %}
    <a class="insta" href="https://instagram.com/{{ site.instagram_poetry }}" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">
      <span class="insta-label">Aur kavi ki kavitaien</span>
      <span class="insta-handle">@{{ site.instagram_poetry }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</article>
